      "body": "Purpose\r\nFix #44358. vLLM's tracing emits two span attributes that are deprecated in the OTel GenAI semantic conventions:\r\n\r\ngen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens → renamed to gen_ai.usage.input_tokens\r\ngen_ai.usage.completion_tokens → renamed to gen_ai.usage.output_tokens\r\nThis PR dual-emits both the legacy names and the current spec names so existing dashboards and collectors keep working during the migration window. The legacy names can be dropped in a future PR once adoption of the new names is widespread.\r\n\r\nNo existing PR addresses this — confirmed via gh pr list --repo vllm-project/vllm --state open --search \"44358 in:body\"\r\n\r\nTest Plan\r\nRun the pre-commit linters on the changed files:\r\n\r\npre-commit run ruff-check --files vllm/tracing/utils.py vllm/v1/engine/output_processor.py\r\n\r\npre-commit run ruff-format --files vllm/tracing/utils.py vllm/v1/engine/output_processor.py\r\n\r\nTest Result\r\nruff check...........Passed\r\n\r\nruff format..........Passed\r\n\r\nAI assistance (Claude) was used to identify the issue and implement the fix. \r\n",
